>

  <h1>Rapid Test vs ELISA</h1>

  <div class="card">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th></th><th>Rapid test (lateral flow)</th><th>ELISA</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><th>Format</th><td>Single-use device</td><td>Microplate, multi-well</td></tr>
